WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.170
Hey, friends.

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:06.786
Our time together is too precious to spend making someone feel small.

00:00:06.786 --> 00:00:11.050
Making fun of someone can hurt, even when we call it a joke.

00:00:11.752 --> 00:00:14.571
If someone feels hurt, let's stop and listen.

00:00:14.571 --> 00:00:16.250
We all make mistakes.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.000
What matters is what we choose next.

00:00:19.744 --> 00:00:23.973
We can say sorry, make things right, and help someone feel included.

00:00:23.973 --> 00:00:26.758
It's never too late to choose kindness.

00:00:26.758 --> 00:00:27.645
You matter.

00:00:27.645 --> 00:00:28.888
They matter too.

00:00:28.888 --> 00:00:31.200
Let's make room for everyone.
